 0  deny   t__anything                     frozen                        agentgate is frozen; run `agentgate unfreeze` to let calls through again
 1  allow  t__poll                         -                             default allow
 2  deny   t__poll                         loop-guard                    loop guard: the identical call has been made 2 times in a row; change the arguments or stop
 3  deny   t__poll                         loop-guard                    loop guard: the identical call has been made 7 times in a row; change the arguments or stop
 4  allow  t__fast                         -                             default allow
 5  deny   t__fast                         budget                        budget: rate limit of 3 calls per minute reached, slow down
 6  allow  t__chatty                       -                             default allow
 7  deny   t__chatty                       budget                        budget: session limit of roughly 1000 tokens through tools reached
 8  ask    t__wipe                         ask-before-destructive        the server marks this tool as destructive
 9  allow  t__list                         read-only-is-fine             matched rule read-only-is-fine (*)
10  allow  t__unlabelled                   -                             default allow
11  deny   t__deploy                       no-deploys-on-friday-afternoon  no deploys on Friday afternoon
12  allow  t__deploy                       -                             default allow
13  ask    t__deploy                       weekends-need-approval        matched rule weekends-need-approval (t.deploy)
14  allow  t__deploy                       -                             default allow
15  allow  t__deploy                       -                             default allow
